{"seq":1,"slug":"nas-problem","title":"NAS 问题与动机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/neural-architecture-search-automl/foundations/nas-problem","wordCount":1827,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"nas-问题与动机\">NAS 问题与动机</h1><p>ResNet 的残差连接、Transformer 的多头注意力、MobileNet 的深度可分离卷积——这些改变了整个领域的结构创新，无一例外是人类专家在大量实验后凝练出来的。每一个都凝结了团队数月乃至数年的试错。神经架构搜索（Neural Architecture Search, NAS）问的是一个直白的问题：既然我们已经能用梯度下降自动学网络的权重，为什么不能也自动学网络的结构？把架构设计从专家直觉变成一个可优化的问题，就是 NAS 的全部动机。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-nas-的三件套框架\">核心概念：NAS 的三件套框架</h2><p>NAS 不是单一算法，而是一个把「自动设计架构」拆成三个正交组件的框架。这三件套是理解整个领域的坐标系，本 hub 的每一章都对应着在其中某个组件上做文章。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[搜索空间&lt;br/&gt;所有候选架构的集合] --&gt; B[搜索策略&lt;br/&gt;如何在空间里挑候选]&#10;    B --&gt; C[性能评估&lt;br/&gt;如何判断候选好坏]&#10;    C --&gt;|反馈信号&lt;br/&gt;精度/延迟| B&#10;    C --&gt; D[输出最优架构]&#10;    A -.约束.-&gt; B\">flowchart TD\n    A[搜索空间&lt;br/&gt;所有候选架构的集合] --&gt; B[搜索策略&lt;br/&gt;如何在空间里挑候选]\n    B --&gt; C[性能评估&lt;br/&gt;如何判断候选好坏]\n    C --&gt;|反馈信号&lt;br/&gt;精度/延迟| B\n    C --&gt; D[输出最优架构]\n    A -.约束.-&gt; B</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>搜索空间（Search Space）</strong>：定义了哪些架构是「合法」的候选。它决定了 NAS 的天花板——再强的策略也找不到不在空间里的结构。详见 <a href=\"search-space\">搜索空间设计</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>搜索策略（Search Strategy）</strong>：在搜索空间里决定「下一个试哪个」的算法，是强化学习、进化、梯度还是贝叶斯优化。这是 <a href=\"../search-strategies/\">搜索策略</a> 一整章的主题。</li>\n<li><strong>性能评估（Performance Estimation）</strong>：判断一个候选好不好的方式。诚实评估要完整训练，这正是 NAS 成本的根源，详见 <a href=\"search-eval-basics\">搜索与评估基础</a> 与 <a href=\"../efficiency/\">效率</a> 整章。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这三件套互相牵制：搜索空间越大表达力越强，但搜索策略越难收敛；评估越诚实越准，但成本越高。NAS 的全部艺术就在这三者的权衡里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么手工设计架构会触到天花板\">为什么手工设计架构会触到天花板</h2><p>手工设计有三个固有局限。第一是<strong>组合爆炸</strong>：一个 20 层的网络，每层在卷积核大小、通道数、是否跳连之间各有十几种选择，组合数远超人类能系统遍历的规模，专家只能探索其中极小的一隅。第二是<strong>直觉迁移困难</strong>：在 ImageNet 上验证有效的结构创新，未必能迁移到语音、时序或图数据上，每个新领域几乎都要从头积累直觉。第三是<strong>目标耦合</strong>：当部署目标不只是精度，还包括手机延迟、芯片内存、能耗时，人脑很难同时在多个冲突目标间手动平衡——这正是 <a href=\"../automl-applications/hardware-aware\">硬件感知 NAS</a> 要自动化的。</p>\n<p>NAS 把这三个局限都转化成可计算的优化问题。形式上，NAS 求解的是一个双层优化：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>α</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi></mrow></munder><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msup><mi>w</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>α</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>s.t.</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msup><mi>w</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>w</mi></munder><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha^* = \\arg\\max_{\\alpha \\in \\mathcal{A}} \\; \\mathrm{Acc}_{val}\\big(w^*(\\alpha), \\alpha\\big), \\quad \\text{s.t.} \\quad w^*(\\alpha) = \\arg\\min_w \\mathcal{L}_{train}(w, \\alpha)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6217em;vertical-align:-0.7717em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7717em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Acc</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s.t.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.45em;vertical-align:-0.7em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ain</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 是架构（来自搜索空间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{A}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 是该架构的权重。外层在验证集上挑架构，内层在训练集上学权重。这个双层结构是 NAS 一切难度的来源——每评估一个外层的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>，都要解一遍内层的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>w</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w^*(\\alpha)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，也就是训练一个完整网络。</p>\n<h2 id=\"nas-的历史脉络\">NAS 的历史脉络</h2><p>NAS 的现代史可以分成三个阶段，成本是贯穿其中的主线。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>代表工作</th>\n<th>年份</th>\n<th>搜索策略</th>\n<th>典型成本</th>\n<th>关键贡献</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>启蒙期</td>\n<td>NAS with RL（Zoph &amp; Le）</td>\n<td>2017</td>\n<td>强化学习</td>\n<td>~800 GPU·天</td>\n<td>证明自动搜索能超越手工架构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>启蒙期</td>\n<td>NASNet</td>\n<td>2018</td>\n<td>强化学习 + cell</td>\n<td>~2000 GPU·天</td>\n<td>提出可迁移的 cell 搜索空间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>启蒙期</td>\n<td>AmoebaNet</td>\n<td>2019</td>\n<td>正则化进化</td>\n<td>~3150 GPU·天</td>\n<td>进化首次在大规模上超越 RL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提效期</td>\n<td>ENAS</td>\n<td>2018</td>\n<td>RL + 权重共享</td>\n<td>~0.45 GPU·天</td>\n<td>权重共享把成本砍千倍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提效期</td>\n<td>DARTS</td>\n<td>2019</td>\n<td>梯度</td>\n<td>~1-4 GPU·天</td>\n<td>可微分搜索成主流范式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成熟期</td>\n<td>Once-for-All</td>\n<td>2020</td>\n<td>超网 + 渐进收缩</td>\n<td>训练一次复用</td>\n<td>训练一次、按需部署</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成熟期</td>\n<td>零成本代理</td>\n<td>2021+</td>\n<td>训练无关打分</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>单次前向反向给架构评分</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>2017 年 Zoph 和 Le 那个烧掉约 800 块 GPU 的开创性工作，证明了自动搜索能找到比当时手工设计更好的网络，但成本之高让它更像一个「土豪才玩得起」的概念验证。整个领域此后的发展，本质上是一部「把这个成本降下来」的历史：从权重共享（<a href=\"../efficiency/weight-sharing\">超网</a>）到<a href=\"../efficiency/performance-prediction\">性能预测器</a>再到<a href=\"../efficiency/zero-cost-proxies\">零成本代理</a>，每一步都在攻评估这个瓶颈。到 2026 年，在 NAS-Bench-201 这类标准基准上，一次完整的架构搜索已经能在单张消费级显卡上几小时内完成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三件套之间的成本传导\">三件套之间的成本传导</h2><p>理解 NAS 难度的关键，是看清三件套如何把成本互相传导。搜索空间一旦变大，搜索策略需要的评估次数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 通常随之上升，而每次评估的成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 又取决于评估方式。把总成本写开就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Cost</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>策略</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>评估</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Cost} \\approx N(\\mathcal{A}, \\text{策略}) \\times T(\\text{评估})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cost</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">策略</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">评估</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>——它同时被三件套牵着。这解释了一个常被误解的现象：很多论文宣称自己的搜索策略「更高效」，其实只是换了个更小的搜索空间（压低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>）或更便宜的评估方式（压低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>），策略本身未必更聪明。</p>\n<p>这条传导链也指明了降本的两个独立旋钮。第一个旋钮在策略侧：用样本更高效的搜索（如<a href=\"../search-strategies/bayesian-smbo\">贝叶斯优化</a>）减少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>。第二个旋钮在评估侧：用更便宜的代理减少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>，这是<a href=\"../efficiency/\">效率</a>整章的主题。两个旋钮正交，可以同时拧——这正是 2026 年最强 NAS 流水线的做法：贝叶斯采样叠加权重共享，再叠加零成本代理粗筛。判断一个 NAS 方法时，先把它的「快」拆解到这两个旋钮上，才能看清它的高效到底是真本事还是换了赛道。</p>\n<h2 id=\"nas-与更大的-automl-版图\">NAS 与更大的 AutoML 版图</h2><p>NAS 常被单独讨论，但它其实是 AutoML（自动化机器学习）的一个子问题。AutoML 想自动化的是整条机器学习流水线：数据预处理、特征工程、模型选择、超参优化、架构设计。NAS 专攻其中「架构设计」一环，而它和「超参优化」共享了大量算法——贝叶斯优化、Hyperband 既能搜架构也能调学习率。把 NAS 放回这个版图，能帮你判断什么时候真的需要搜架构（结构创新空间大、有充足算力），什么时候一个调好超参的成熟架构就够了。这层关系是 <a href=\"../automl-applications/hpo-automl\">超参优化与 AutoML</a> 的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>NAS 把「设计网络」形式化为三件套：搜索空间、搜索策略、性能评估，三者互相权衡，构成全 hub 的坐标系。</li>\n<li>手工设计受组合爆炸、直觉迁移难、多目标耦合三重限制；NAS 把它们转化为一个双层优化问题。</li>\n<li>NAS 的历史是一部降本史：从 2017 年约 800 GPU·天，到 2026 年单卡数小时，核心突破都在「如何更便宜地评估候选」。</li>\n<li>NAS 是 AutoML 的子问题，和超参优化共享算法工具箱；该不该用 NAS，取决于结构创新空间与可用算力。</li>\n<li>想深入，可顺着 <a href=\"search-space\">搜索空间设计</a> → <a href=\"search-eval-basics\">搜索与评估基础</a> 继续，建立完整的基础语言。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"NAS 问题与动机","id":"nas-问题与动机"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：NAS 的三件套框架","id":"核心概念-nas-的三件套框架"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么手工设计架构会触到天花板","id":"为什么手工设计架构会触到天花板"},{"level":2,"text":"NAS 的历史脉络","id":"nas-的历史脉络"},{"level":2,"text":"三件套之间的成本传导","id":"三件套之间的成本传导"},{"level":2,"text":"NAS 与更大的 AutoML 版图","id":"nas-与更大的-automl-版图"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"搜索空间设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/neural-architecture-search-automl/foundations/search-space"}}